 "description": "Digi Connect IT 16 is a 1U rack-mount serial server (console server) with sixteen RJ-45 RS-232 serial ports and a console jack. It also has two 10/100/1000 Ethernet ports, two SFP+ cages and two USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type A ports. The front carries the console jack and the USB ports in one housing. The Ethernet jacks and the SFP+ cages are stacked in pairs. The sixteen serial jacks are in two rows. The rear carries two field-replaceable power supplies and a system fan. It also has the CORE module plate with two WWAN antenna openings, an SD slot, a reset pinhole and a column of status lamps. One power supply kit is mandatory, ITPS-PSEK (port-side exhaust) or ITPS-PSIK (port-side intake).",
